  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reverse Trade Mission - Access Africa Reverse Trade Mission Series, through Business Council for International Understanding</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Access Africa reverse trade mission series will consist of three separate and distinct reverse trade missions (RTMs), which will familiarize public and/or private sector representatives from Sub-Saharan Africa with the latest U.S. technologies, services, and best practices in the ICT sector. The RTMs will include meetings with U.S. industry representatives, associations, financial institutions, and U.S. government agencies.</narrative>
  </description>
